<title>CROATIA: Croatian May crude, natural gas output rise.</title>
<headline>Croatian May crude, natural gas output rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Croatian State Bureau of Statistics issued the following energy output data:</p>
<p>					  MAY	 APRIL	MAY '96</p>
<p> Crude (tonnes)		   132,225    123,281     121,008</p>
<p> Natural gas (thousand cu m)  148,496    140,548     138,979</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCTS (tonnes)</p>
<p> Gasoline			    95,381     61,672	78,712</p>
<p> Gas oil			     56,537     20,722	91,127</p>
<p> Heating oil			132,896     97,554     150,044</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
